; Alice pays, then Bob does what the prohibition forbids. The whole trace is a
; violated trace of "alice MUST pay THEN bob MUST_NOT leak". Its status is DONE
; at entry 1: the prohibition completes at once, so the term has been executed
; when Alice pays, and the observation of the term ends there (formal/core/CORE.md,
; decision 34). Two obligations in sequence are not discharged by one payment.
(scenario sequence_prohibition_violated
  (spec "examples/core/core_sequence.triel")
  (entry "2026-06-01T09:00:00Z" (activate)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T10:00:00Z" (act alice pay must)
    (data))
  (entry "2026-06-01T11:00:00Z" (act bob leak must_not)
    (data)))
